asbestos-free product."

589
00:25:58,200 --> 00:26:00,450
So each in turn became a member

590
00:26:00,450 --> 00:26:02,760
of this conspiracy of silence.

591
00:26:02,760 --> 00:26:05,940
That is how the asbestos
industry guaranteed its survival,

